                    {
                        "sense_id": "09e57e22-c4de-3173-bdda-1d4fbcdfa133",
                        "entry_id": "29e2c4b8-5fe6-31d3-b51e-57abc9b729f3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A violent explosion, or the pattern (likened to the shape of a star) supposed to be made by such an explosion."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0efa2860-2e33-4134-9eec-de56b4cf5661",
                                "sense_id": "09e57e22-c4de-3173-bdda-1d4fbcdfa133",
                                "text": "[…] his arm striking brick and the bottle shattering in a starburst of black […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2258eb3b-b6ed-4940-bf2f-9728e1ad6f02",
                                "sense_id": "09e57e22-c4de-3173-bdda-1d4fbcdfa133",
                                "text": "A starburst of red exploded on his chest and he flew backward a good six or seven feet."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "46f12983-207d-48f6-b25c-424132b8241a",
                                "sense_id": "09e57e22-c4de-3173-bdda-1d4fbcdfa133",
                                "text": "[…] and another that creates a cicatrix starburst from her right eye to her temple. This scar is the result of an accident when she was ten years old, […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "af7a3dd3-62af-31f6-aecc-22bd0128ac1f",
                        "entry_id": "29e2c4b8-5fe6-31d3-b51e-57abc9b729f3",
